    <!-- Prominent Accessibility Service Disclosure -->
    <string name="accessibility_disclosure_title">Accessibility Service Disclosure</string>
    <string name="accessibility_disclosure_intro">Fast Dial requires access to Android\'s Accessibility Service (\'USSD Flow Automation Service\') to automate USSD menu navigation and responses.</string>
    <string name="accessibility_disclosure_purpose_title">Why Accessibility Service is Required:</string>
    <string name="accessibility_disclosure_purpose_body">Standard Android applications cannot interact directly with carrier USSD system pop-ups. The Accessibility Service allows Fast Dial to perform the following strictly automated actions during flow execution:</string>
    <string name="accessibility_disclosure_bullet1">• Read text on carrier USSD dialog windows to detect menu prompts.</string>
    <string name="accessibility_disclosure_bullet2">• Automatically input menu selection numbers or user parameters into USSD response fields.</string>
    <string name="accessibility_disclosure_bullet3">• Automatically click the \'Send\' button to proceed to the next step in your automation sequence.</string>
    <string name="accessibility_disclosure_privacy_title">Privacy &amp; Data Protection Declaration:</string>
    <string name="accessibility_disclosure_privacy_body">• LOCAL EXECUTION &amp; LOGGING: USSD screen content and entered values (such as recipient numbers and transaction amounts) are temporarily processed in real time and may be locally logged in the app\'s execution history on your device for your own reference.\n• NEVER TRANSMITTED EXTERNALLY: All execution history and processed data remain strictly on-device and are never transmitted to or shared with any external server or third party.\n• NO BACKGROUND SURVEILLANCE: The Accessibility Service is only active during explicitly user-triggered USSD flow runs and does not monitor background activity.</string>
    <string name="accessibility_disclosure_agree_button">Agree &amp; Enable in Settings</string>
    <string name="accessibility_disclosure_deny_button">Decline</string>

